{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Swarm 2</strong> is the sequel to my Abyssal Boss Rush! <br>Faster, more dynamic, more exhilarating!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a deep-sea creature commanding a swarm of <strong>hornets</strong>, and annihilate your enemies using a wide range of powers and mutations at your disposal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improvements and Additions:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Digestion system</strong> for hornet generation. The stats and effects of your hornets vary depending on what you consume.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mutation system</strong> that you can equip to enhance your abilities and overall power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge system</strong> to unlock even more unique mutations!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental damage system</strong> (electricity, necrosis, frost, poison, bleeding).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improved performance</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Even more epic music!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss will make you explore a new way to play and force you to adapt your combat approach!<br><br><strong>In this demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against the first boss and experience your first mutations!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the basics of your creature's abilities and master the timing of dodges and parries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for the increasing difficulty of the full game by finding your own combat style.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3917130?t=1754514451","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917130/3aab33e290eae342729a43e031b8949bc647b624/page_bg_raw.jp