p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental damage system</strong> (electricity, necrosis, frost, poison, bleeding).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improved performance</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Even more epic music!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss will make you explore a new way to play and force you to adapt your combat approach!<br><br><strong>In this demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against the first boss and experience your first mutations!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the basics of your creature's abilities and master the timing of dodges and parries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for the increasing difficulty of the full game by finding your own combat style.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Solsgames"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3874330","name":"The Swarm 2"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917130/a7aa75b0c8f57cbfd00648641a7c014bd57b5b93/header.jpg?t=1754514451","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257176641,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176641/movie480.mp4?t=1754513545","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176641/movie_max.mp4?t=1754513545"},"name":"The Swarm 2 Alpha Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257176641/9d0d594e5628d5ce255a57ce1fb956a2ffe87c53/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754513545","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176641/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1754513545","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176641/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1754513545"}}],"name":"The Swarm 2 Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><